{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">方力申（Alex）自女兒Isla出世後，其社交平台就幾乎淪為囡囡的成長集。而Isla的可愛冧樣以及與方力申如出一轍的「餅印」臉，更是俘虜大批網民喜愛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">近日，方力申再度出招，成功獲得小公主初次獻吻，直言開心到傻咗！從影片可見，為了得到囡囡的錫錫，方力申不惜以Isla至愛的美食作吸引，當Isla主動湊前咬住食物時，方力申趁機奪吻，隨即激動到狂跳兼舉手歡呼。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b775c855-e604-47bd-9129-5973958d14a6.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026vNlbeSaHhI1786416999.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b775c855-e604-47bd-9129-5973958d14a6.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"67907afc-1a1b-4c28-b179-0a2641851540.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20265OouI08Ro21786416999.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"67907afc-1a1b-4c28-b179-0a2641851540.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2503796f-a867-48a6-803b-0cbbec6eb213.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026nBNkusHgqk1786416999.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2503796f-a867-48a6-803b-0cbbec6eb213.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">他在帖文中亦難掩興奮寫道：「你哋講咩都好，我唔理。總之，Isla第一次「主動」咀嘴爸爸」。不少網民看完大讚畫面sweet爆，指Isla非常配合爸爸；亦有不少人笑指方力申招數「古惑」，方力申幽默親回：「要教識佢，其他人係唔得嘅。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T05:19:03.571437+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}